{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0147",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "但是如果你能堅定自己的想法，規劃好將來的打算，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But if you can hold firmly to your own thoughts and make clear plans for the future,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "並願意找我商量的話，就算我幫不了你多少，還是願意為你的重整旗鼓助一臂之力。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and if you are willing to come and talk it over with me, then even if I cannot help you very much, I would still like to lend a hand as you start over.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你聽懂了嗎？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Do you understand?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "今後你到底打算怎麼辦呢？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What exactly do you intend to do from now on?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "「如果不能在這個二樓繼續住的話，我就出去工作……」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"If I cannot go on living here on the second floor, I will go out and work...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "「你不是開玩笑的吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"You cannot be joking, can you?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "如今的社會，就算是畢業於帝國大學，找工作也不是……」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In society today, even someone who has graduated from Imperial University cannot simply find work...\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "「不，我不想成為上班族。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"No, I do not want to become an office worker.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "「那做什麼？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Then what will you do?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "「當畫家。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"I will be a painter.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "我斗膽地說出了這句話。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I ventured to say those words.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "「咦？」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Eh?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00147",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "當時，比目魚縮著脖子大笑，他那張臉上流露出的狡黠，我一生都不會忘記。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At that moment, Hirame laughed with his neck drawn in, and I will never forget the slyness that appeared on his face.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
